=====================================================
Reads the GHY Manager List tracker from the synced SharePoint folder,
extracts headline statistics and FX/region/country breakdowns from each
manager's response spreadsheet, and outputs a consolidated Excel + HTML
report back into the same SharePoint folder.

SETUP FOR NEW USERS
-------------------
1. Sync the SharePoint folder to your local machine:
   - Go to: https://maml.sharepoint.com/sites/ManagerSelectionOverview2/Searches/Forms/GHY%20Manager%20Responses.aspx
   - Click "Sync" in the toolbar — this syncs via OneDrive to your local machine
   - The synced folder will appear under:
     C:\\Users\\<YOUR_USERNAME>\\Mediolanum International Funds\\Manager Selection Overview - GHY Manager Responses

2. If auto-detection fails, set SHAREPOINT_FOLDER below to your local synced path.

3. Run:  python ghy_manager_consolidation.py

Outputs (GHY_Manager_Consolidated.xlsx and .html) are saved directly into the
SharePoint folder and will sync back automatically. Each run overwrites the
previous version.
"""

